  "description": "Client API needed to interact with the ElephantSqlDB cloud database storage services.  If your application requires cloud storage of unstructured JSON or key/value paired data, the ElephantSqlDB client is an affordable and extremely fast alernative to any of the following solutions:\n\t\t1.  ActiveMQ\n\t\t2.  AWS DynamoDB\n\t\t3.  Azure CosmoDB\n\t\t4.  Google Cloud Datastore\n\t\t5.  Oracle NoSQL Database\n\t\t6.  PostgreSQL\n\t\t7.  MongoDB\n\t\t8.  RavenDB\n\t\t9.  Redis\n\t\t10. Supabase\n\t\t11. Couchbase",
